but again this is only an approximate local width.

It must **not** become a uniform 2–4 px yellow outline.

Its width should expand, contract, thin, and occasionally partially break around the coastline.

The sand layer should generally remain narrower than the underlying light-green glyph region.

Conceptually:

```text
